# Mobile Development

## Structure

Components are colocated in the mobile app (no separate ui-mobile package):

```
apps/mobile/src/
├── components/
│   ├── ui/           # Reusable UI components (Button, Input, Card)
│   └── common/       # Shared app components
├── features/
│   └── [name]/
│       ├── screens/
│       ├── components/
│       ├── hooks/
│       ├── services/
│       └── index.ts
├── services/
│   └── api/          # API client and shared services
├── navigation/
├── store/
└── constants/
```

## Styling

- Native StyleSheet.create() only
- No NativeWind or Tailwind
- Design tokens from @/constants

## Icons

- Import icons ONLY from `@/components/icons`
- NEVER import directly from `lucide-react-native`
- To add new icons, update `apps/mobile/src/components/icons.ts`

```typescript
// Good
import { User, Settings } from '@/components/icons';

// Bad - never do this
import { User } from 'lucide-react-native';
```

## Services

```typescript
// services/api/client.ts
export const apiClient = axios.create({
  baseURL: Config.API_URL,
});

// features/accounts/services/account.service.ts
export const accountService = {
  getAll: () => apiClient.get<Account[]>('/accounts'),
  getById: (id: string) => apiClient.get<Account>(`/accounts/${id}`),
};
```

## Navigation

- React Navigation with typed RootStackParamList
- Feature screens in features/[name]/screens/

## Forms

- react-hook-form for all forms
- zod (v4 API) for validation

## Animations (Reanimated)

- Use `react-native-reanimated` for performant animations
- Babel plugin must be last in plugins array

## Performance

- FlatList for lists (never ScrollView + map)
- useCallback, useMemo, React.memo
- Profile with Flipper
- Reanimated runs on UI thread (60fps)

## Security

- Keychain (iOS) / Keystore (Android) for tokens
- Never use AsyncStorage for sensitive data

